Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninth Episode\NThe Broken Idols
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.01,0:02:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sapphire's castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.18,0:02:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the gallows!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.06,0:02:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Has Sapphire not come yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,These clothes are to be worn for the 900-Year Tower Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It is all thanks to that tower that Silverland has been protected for 900 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.73,0:03:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you must be properly dressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yees... Are we done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "yet"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I haven't even eaten my meal yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To commemorate 900 years ago, you are to eat the exact same meal as in the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You must eat it properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,In imitation of those impoverished times, you must not take more than a single bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let us go—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I have brought Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The prince, you say?\NWhere is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he vanished into thin air!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.39,0:03:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot possibly start such an important ceremony like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and look for Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we went to all the trouble of dressing you properly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,, Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like something from a cheap play!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,O noble ancestors of Silverland, today we perform the cleaning and upkeep of the demon-repelling idols...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...Are we ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, please enter one by one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.69,0:05:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, it's so high...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, everyone, as you were told, go up and down the stairs in order!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an idol here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What a funny face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you must not touch or move the sacred idols as you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, open the windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please open the windows and begin cleaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I see it, it has such a fine face, so fitting for warding off evil spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, truly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, is something like this really a demon repeller?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool, don't look down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not look down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what punishment awaits one who breaks an idol?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you scratch an idol's face, your own face will be slashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you injure its hand, it eats your face; if you injure its foot, it eats your foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you chop off its head, you will be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you are daughters of nobility like yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, don't say such terrifying things!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.55,0:08:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some pity on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Your Highness! Thank you so very, very much for saving that idol...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! I'm returning it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.34,0:08:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That idol is safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you, Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.73,0:08:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Easy there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss, snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who knows the details is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, No, No, No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Your Majesty, please put your seal on this death warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,On a child like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well, do as you see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do to Tink?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink? You mean that notorious villain who was sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Death sentence?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:10:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he broke a demon-warding idol, so it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because idols like this exist that people are getting killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.95,0:11:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there another fool who broke an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, regarding the death warrant, your seal...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, stamp it yourself. It's late and I'm sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you prepare my bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin, isn't there some way we can put a stop to this execution?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really acceptable to do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If we do not punish the one who broke the idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland will suffer a demon's curse for as many idols as were destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are fine with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, wait, that would also be a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.99,0:11:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A very big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't that my child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.80,0:12:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth... what on earth is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.97,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is my dau... dau... son being executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I received proper authorization.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire broke 30 idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That many... Sapphire, what in the world... what in the world have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.19,0:12:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you have done something terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it, if only I could get untied...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I shall respectfully carry out the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.82,0:13:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Queen, Queen, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, please let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't go, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, we have been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you going to execute this child?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch what I do carefully and become a fine executioner!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, the Knight of the Ribbon didn't last long, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, throw the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.73,0:14:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank You!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.89,0:14:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire has done something reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, Sapphire is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa-Sa-Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.47,0:14:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire has done something reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, shoot him down with bows!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralamin, you mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.86,0:14:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is more important: the life of a single prince, or Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please stand on the execution platform!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please think of how grieved your parents would be if you met such a shameful death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.76,0:15:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really set on killing me no matter what, aren't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.27,0:15:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.70,0:16:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The women are saying they're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,break the idols to save Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let that happen, stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you stop too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.98,0:16:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.85,0:16:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere with what I'm doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,for us too, in this... Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, stop, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You good-for-nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The execution is called off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture the women!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The women are smarter than the men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.22,0:17:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying something like this is worse than a demon!
Comment: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:13.33,Karaoke - 09 broken doll - Castle Women in Prison,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k12}{\k38}La, {\k25}la {\k27}la {\k25}la, {\k20}la {\k34}la {\k43}la
